{"kind":"github_issue","repository":"Trae-AI/TRAE","item":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/1872","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/1872/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/1872/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/1872/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/1872","id":3704142604,"node_id":"I_kwDONiYvnc7cyLsM","number":1872,"title":"Feature Request: 通用化接入兼容 OpenAI 协议的第三方模型服务","user":{"login":"tap6","id":23492851,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzNDkyODUx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/23492851?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tap6","html_url":"https://github.com/tap6","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tap6/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tap6/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tap6/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tap6/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tap6/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tap6/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tap6/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tap6/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tap6/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":13,"created_at":"2025-12-07T23:44:02Z","updated_at":"2026-04-16T08:17:06Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"目前 Trae 已经能够很好地接入主流第三方服务商，这一点非常好。但在实际使用中，仍有不少中小型服务商（例如七牛云的 AI 推理接口：[七牛 AI Inference API](https://developer.qiniu.com/aitokenapi/12882/ai-inference-api)）尚无法被 Trae 直接支持。\n\n这些服务商的一个共同特点是：\n它们本身已经提供了 兼容 OpenAI API 或 Anthropic API 协议格式的接口。理论上具备被快速接入的基础条件，但如果每一家都通过“单独适配”的方式接入，无论是对 Trae 还是对社区来说，长期来看都会带来较高的人力维护成本，这在现实中也比较困难。\n\n基于此，我想提出一个能力层面的需求设想：\nTrae 是否可以像 Cursor 一样，支持通过配置可重定向的 OpenAI Base URL + API Key 的方式接入第三方兼容接口，从而让这些小众服务商“零或低成本”接入 Trae？\n\n不过在调研和实践中，我也发现这种方式目前在 Cursor 中存在一个明显问题：\n当我将 OpenAI 接口重定向到第三方之后，会 影响 Cursor 自家原本部署的 GPT 系列模型的正常使用。也就是说，当前的重定向方案是“全局替换”的，而我们的实际诉求是：\n\n使用自有模型时，走 第三方兼容接口；\n\n使用 官方模型时，仍然走 OpenAI / Anthropic 官方接口；\n\n两种模式应当能够 并存且互不影响。\n\n因此，综合来看，我更理想的诉求是：\n\nTrae 能否原生支持 小众第三方（兼容 OpenAI/Anthropic 协议）接口的统一接入机制，而不是逐一硬编码适配；\n\n若支持 “Base URL 重定向” 这种方案，是否可以做到 “按模型路由而不是全局替换”；\n\n如果未来还能提供一个 不会影响官方模型使用的“安全重定向方案”，类似于对 Cursor 当前机制的改良版本，那将会对开发者非常有价值。\n\n非常期待 Trae 在多模型、多服务商接入层面的进一步扩展能力，也愿意配合测试相关方案。谢谢维护者的工作与投入。","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/1872/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/1872/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null},"comments":[]}